# Multi-Agent AI Starter

This workspace contains a minimal Python project for building a multi-agent AI workflow.

## Structure

- `src/multi_agent_ai/agents.py` — base agent and workflow logic
- `src/multi_agent_ai/main.py` — example entry point
- `tests/test_multi_agent_ai.py` — starter tests

## Run

```bash
python -m multi_agent_ai.main
```

## Test

```bash
python -m pytest -q
```
